{comment: Verse}
[G]Dashing through the snow, in a [C]one-horse open sleigh
O'er the [D]fields we go, laughing [G]all the way
[G]Bells on bobtail ring, making [C]spirits bright
What fun it [D]is to ride and sing a sleighing song to[G]night [D]

{comment: Chorus}
[G]Jingle bells, jingle bells, jingle all the way
[C]Oh what fun it [G]is to ride in a [A]one-horse open [D]sleigh, hey
